            r"<a href='../sigmoid/'>Sigmoida</a>: logitni $\hat y$ ga aylantiradi; uning $\sigma(1-\sigma)$ hosilasi BCE gradiyentida qisqaradi.",
            r"<a href='../cross-entropy/'>Kategorial kross-entropiya</a>: $K$ sinfga umumlashma; $K=2$ da softmax + CE $z_1-z_2$ logitlar ayirmasidan sigmoida + BCE bilan ustma-ust tushadi.",
